# Personal customisation (your own goals, stats, dietary prefs). Keep this private.
PERSONAL.md
PERSONAL.md.*
!PERSONAL.md.example

# Personal logging shorthand (how the owner types exercises/meals). Keep private.
LOGGING_STYLE.md
LOGGING_STYLE.md.*

# Custom coach voices made with /create. Keep private.
PERSONAS.md
PERSONAS.md.*

# User-dumped training programs / knowledge. Ingested into Notion, never committed.
knowledge/*
!knowledge/README.md
!knowledge/.gitkeep

